      <ownedComment xmi:id="7fa5aae2-b464-46fb-aa3c-a9714daabf4a" body="A boundary is a class that lies on the periphery of a system, but within it. It interacts with actors outside the system as well as with entity, control, and other boundary classes within the system." annotatedElement="59300978-0fa6-4788-88ce-02b8f4c5a935">
